OL,3,ATwo missing as French fishing boat
OL,4,Asinks in Channel
OL,5,
OL,6,FSearches are continuing for two crew
OL,7,Fmembers after a French fishing boat
OL,8,Fsank in the English Channel, the
OL,9,FMaritime and Coastguard Agency said.
OL,11,FA coastguard rescue helicopter,
OL,12,Ffixed-wing plane and two RNLI lifeboats
OL,13,Fbegan searching an area south-west of
OL,14,FEddystone Lighthouse off Plymouth after
OL,15,Fthe crew released a distress call at
OL,16,F18:00 BST on Saturday.
OL,18,FHM Coastguard in Falmouth said three
OL,19,Fpeople were rescued from the boat and
OL,20,Fhave been taken to hospital.
OL,23,APub: 30-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
